# Installer output. /distrib/*.exe above is anchored and matches only direct
# children of distrib, so it never covered out\ -- where ISCC writes the setup,
# hundreds of MB per build. A plain `git add .` would stage all of it.
/distrib/out/
/distrib/*.log
# The VC++ 2015-2022 x64 redist the installer bundles. 25 MB of Microsoft binary
# has no business in a source repo, and it must not be committed under a
# redistributable claim the source offer can't back. build_unplugged_setup.ps1
# refuses to build without it and prints the official URL, so an absent file is a
# loud error rather than a runtime-less payload.
/distrib/redist/

# OMDb API key shipped with the app - never committed
src/unplugged-ui/src/mpvprocessor/media/_omdb_key.py
